msgstr "Wyszarzone w VR: VR zawsze uruchamia DLAA na gotowym obrazie."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Switched off by the mod: it cost more than %.1f ms per eye (VR budget). Press its key to try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Wyłączone przez mod: kosztowało więcej niż %.1f ms na oko (budżet VR). Naciśnij jego klawisz, by "
"spróbować ponownie."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls per frame now; off saves it."
msgstr "Kosztuje teraz %ls na klatkę; wył. to oszczędza."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Costs %ls ms GPU per frame now; most of it at night."
msgstr "Kosztuje teraz %ls ms GPU na klatkę; najwięcej w nocy."

