#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "CPU %ls ms per frame; it saves GPU time in the game's own figure."
msgstr "CPU %ls ms na klatkę; oszczędza GPU w liczbie samej gry."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "It saves time in the game's own GPU figure, not in the mod's."
